    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "export_text",
      "x": 548, "y": 608, "width": 504, "height": 139,
      "text": "from_influxdb_to_parquet_local.py  |  Python 3.11\n\n1. Lade .env Konfiguration (INFLUXDB_*, BASE_PATH, CHUNK_*)\n2. Discover Measurements (schema.measurements)\n3. Chunk-Query (CHUNK_HOURS=1) mit Retry-Logik\n4. Pivot: Fields als separate Spalten\n5. pandas -> polars -> Parquet (zstd)\n6. Log -> export_log.csv",
      "originalText": "from_influxdb_to_parquet_local.py  |  Python 3.11\n\n1. Lade .env Konfiguration (INFLUXDB_*, BASE_PATH, CHUNK_*)\n2. Discover Measurements (schema.measurements)\n3. Chunk-Query (CHUNK_HOURS=1) mit Retry-Logik\n4. Pivot: Fields als separate Spalten\n5. pandas -> polars -> Parquet (zstd)\n6. Log -> export_log.csv",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 102800, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 102801,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": "export_rect", "lineHeight": 1.25
